(text "TRIPTRACER V1 | 01I LM74800-Q1 COMMON-SOURCE INPUT PROTECTION | REV A / ELECTRICAL WIP" (at 30.48 19.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000202"))
(text "Q921 D->VIN, S->A. Q922 S1/S2/S3->A, D5->protected buck VIN. U921 TI DRR0012E RTN PAD13 SOLDER TO ISOLATED PAD, NEVER GND." (at 30.48 36.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000203"))
(text "ACC START upstream: 01H Q915 emitter receives LM748_VS_SAFE, not switched VOUT. BUCK_ENABLE controls U921 EN/UVLO and U101 buck EN." (at 30.48 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000204"))
(text "OV CUT-OFF TI Fig10-25: VSNS & SW tied to clamped VS (<=70V), R932->R933->OV->R934->GND TOP FED FROM RAW BAT BEFORE Q921. Nominal 36.31V; worst-case limits/open." (at 30.48 135.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000205"))
(text "EXTERNAL vehicle BAT/ACC fuses required. LM74800 is NOT an eFuse: short circuit / FET SOA / ISO surge remain OPEN." (at 30.48 389.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000206"))
(text "TI EVM CS C10=15nF on RTN PAD13 to AGND conflicts with datasheet RTN FLOAT; OMIT pending TI clarification. C924=1uF on A to GND." (at 30.48 372.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000207"))
(text "R921 200V/350ms pulse >= 0.7J and VS zener thermal NOT QUALIFIED. NEVER ORDER / USE IN VEHICLE." (at 30.48 406.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000208"))
